<title>CHILE: Outokumpu Chile plant study ready end '97.</title>
<headline>Outokumpu Chile plant study ready end '97.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's Outokumpu Oy expects to have the results of a feasibility study on a $800 million copper smelting and refining project in Chile by the end of the year, said the firm's CEO Jyrki Juusela.</p>
<p>&quot;We are preparing a feasibility study and at the end of the year we will know much more,&quot; Juusela told reporters after a meeting with Mining Minister Benjamin Teplizky. &quot;With such a big project, all the preparation must be done very carefully.&quot;</p>
</text>
